  "body": "Designed by Kim Veltman, this home offers a relaxed lifestyle in a sought-after Bucklands Beach location, just a short walk from the beach, Musick Point and Howick Golf Club.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen and living area flows through to the dining room and out via bifold doors to the outdoor entertaining area, where a resort-style swimming pool provides the perfect spot to cool off during the summer months.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is thoughtfully spread across two levels, with two bedrooms on the ground floor sharing a family bathroom. Upstairs, two further bedrooms each feature walk-in wardrobes and share a bathroom, while a separate lounge enjoys elevated sea views stretching towards the Sky Tower.\r\n\r\nPractical features include a double garage with internal access, a dedicated laundry space, ample storage and plenty of off-street parking, including room for a boat. The plaster construction incorporates a cavity system for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent school zoning for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, making this an appealing opportunity to secure a home in a popular coastal community.",
